 2561) resets a node to GIMMICK_FAIL type\n- `quantifiers_memory_node_info()` (line 4894) recursively traverses node tree reading `NODE_TYPE(node)` \u2014 if node is freed, this is a READ 4 UAF\n- `tune_quant()` (line 5441) calls `quantifiers_memory_node_info(body)` at line 5458, then `tune_tree(body, ...)` at line 5470, then has \"expand string\" optimization (lines 5495-5508) that calls `node_conv_to_str_node(node, body)` + `onig_node_free(body)` \u2014 this converts quantifier to string and frees its body\n- `tune_look_behind()` (line 4472) calls `tune_tree(body)`, then `tree_reduce_in_look_behind(body)`, then `node_char_len(body)` \u2014 if min length is 0, resets node to fail/empty via `onig_node_reset_fail(node)` or `onig_node_reset_empty(node)`\n- `unravel_case_fold_string()` (line 4802) can replace string nodes with list/alt nodes and free old nodes\n- `tune_next()` (line 4542) can wrap quantifiers in BAG_STOP_BACKTRACK nodes via `node_swap`\n- `get_head_value_node()` (line 3168) traverses node tree to find head value\n\nThe vulnerability mechanism: During `tune_tree` processing, the \"expand string\" optimization in `tune_quant` can free a node's body after `quantifiers_memory_node_info` has already been called on it. If the freed node is later accessed (e.g., via `NODE_TYPE` in `quantifiers_memory_node_info` during a parent's processing), it causes a heap-use-after-free READ 4.\n</EVENT>", "action": "condensation", "llm_metrics": {"accumulated_cost": 0.023239854400000013, "accumulated_token_usage": {"model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "prompt_tokens": 2976502, "completion_tokens": 14792, "cache_read_tokens": 2898048, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "response_id": ""}, "costs": [], "response_latencies": [], "token_usages": []}, "args": {"forgotten_event_ids": null, "forgotten_events_start_id": 55, "forgotten_events_end_id": 106, "summary": "<EVENT id=55-106>\n**CmdRunAction (source=EventSource.AGENT, is_input=False)**\nMultiple commands analyzing Oniguruma source code to understand the use-after-free vulnerability mechanism.\n\nKey findings:\n- `node_free_body()` (line 2056) frees node contents based on type; `onig_node_free()` calls `node_free_body()` then `xfree(node)`\n- `node_reset_str()` (line 3292) calls `node_free_body(node)` then `node_set_str(node, s, end)` \u2014 used to reset a node to empty string\n- `node_set_fail()` (line 2561) resets a node to GIMMICK_FAIL type\n- `quantifiers_memory_node_info()` (line 4894) recursively traverses node tree reading `NODE_TYPE(node)` \u2014 if node is freed, this is a READ 4 UAF\n- `tune_quant()` (line 5441) calls `quantifiers_memory_node_info(body)` at line 5458, then `tune_tree(body, ...)` at line 5470, then has \"expand string\" optimization (lines 5495-5508) that calls `node_conv_to_str_node(node, body)` + `onig_node_free(body)` \u2014 this converts quantifier to string and frees its body\n- `tune_look_behind()` (line 4472) calls `tune_tree(body)`, then `tree_reduce_in_look_behind(body)`, then `node_char_len(body)` \u2014 if min length is 0, resets node to fail/empty via `onig_node_reset_fail(node)` or `onig_node_reset_empty(node)`\n- `unravel_case_fold_string()` (line 4802) can replace string nodes with list/alt nodes and free old nodes\n- `tune_next()` (line 4542) can wrap quantifiers in BAG_STOP_BACKTRACK nodes via `node_swap`\n- `get_head_value_node()` (line 3168) traverses node tree to find head value\n\nThe vulnerability mechanism: During `tune_tree` processing, the \"expand string\" optimization in `tune_quant` can free a node's body after `quantifiers_memory_node_info` has already been called on it. If the freed node is later accessed (e.g., via `NODE_TYPE` in `quantifiers_memory_node_info` during a parent's processing), it causes a heap-use-after-free READ 4.\n</EVENT>", "summary_offset": 1}}, {"id": 156, "timestamp": "2026-07-29T18:20:25.831340", "source": "agent", "message": "Running command: cat /workspace/README.md", "action": "run", "tool_call_metadata": {"funct